  "description": "Volero Wave CL3023: one horizontal bar carrying eight independently motorised 220-degree tilt modules. Each module has one 40 W RGBW LED engine with a rectangular mirror-based 86 x 114 mm optical aperture. Eight RGBW pixel cells; the Pixel Engine is a control layer, not extra physical emitters. Overall including supplied brackets: 1000 x 329 x 182 mm; 20.8 kg. Heads face forward at rest.",
